# Captures are evidence, not source.
#
# `docs/ui_audit.md` embeds these so a reader can see what a finding looked like, and they are
# regenerated by re-running the capture, not by editing. Committing them would put versioned binaries
# in a repo whose own rule (FVS-S-30, `EDITOR_BACKLOG.md`) is that reference frames stay out of git —
# and the reason that rule exists is that an agent can now retake any of them without asking for the
# screen.
docs/ui_audit/
docs/kit_review/
